      "rationale": "Upstream official postgres:17-bookworm ships /usr/local/bin/gosu compiled with Go 1.24.6. gosu executes only local privilege-drop syscalls (setuid/setgid/execve) at container entrypoint startup on the internal data_net network and never invokes Go crypto/tls, net/http, net/mail, mime, or xml packages."
